  "fullDescription": "To create botanical stamps with a garden theme using Procreate. Utilize Procreate brushes, particularly those designed for botanical elements, in your garden brush kit. Experiment with different Procreate stamps to craft easy and detailed fruit and veggie drawings. Customize your compositions using the procreate brush kit for a personalized touch in your botanical creations.\n\n♡ What is included:\n\nThere are 99 stamp brushes for Procreate, layered Psd, AI, EPS files as well as 99 individual Png files.\nThose Procreate stamps are so much fun! They save you time and help you easily create beautiful artwork.\n\n♡ Please note:\n\nThe brush set only works in Procreate on the iPad. It doesn’t work in photoshop or any other software. BUT if you don’t have Procreate, you can use the included .png files to make amazing designs :).",
